#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:2
msgid "Color Locator (Discover)"
msgstr "Color Locator (Discover)"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:7
msgid ""
"Another way to use FTC's new OpenCV vision tools is to operate a \"Color "
"Locator\".  Namely, it can **find a target color that you specify**."
msgstr ""
"FTCの新しいOpenCVビジョンツールを使用する別の方法は、「Color Locator」を操作することです。つまり、 **find a target"
" color that you specify** を行うことができます。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:10
msgid ""
"As with the Color Sensor tool, you can specify a **Region of Interest** "
"(ROI). Only that zone of the camera's view will be searched for the target "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Color Sensorツールと同様に、 **Region of Interest** "
"（ROI）を指定することができます。そのカメラの視野のゾーンのみがターゲットカラーを検索します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:13
msgid ""
"The \"target color\" is actually a **range** of numerical color values, for "
"a better chance of finding the desired color."
msgstr "「ターゲットカラー」は、実際には希望する色を見つけるためのより良いチャンスを得るために、数値カラー値の **range** です。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:16
msgid ""
"OpenCV will form **\"Blobs\"** of that color.  As described in the Concepts "
"page here, a Blob is a contiguous cluster of similar-colored pixels."
msgstr ""
"OpenCVはその色の **\"Blobs\"** "
"を形成します。ここにある概念ページで説明されているように、Blobは同じ色のピクセルの連続したクラスターです。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:19
msgid ""
"Blobs often have a complex, irregular shape or **contour**, so they are "
"represented here by a best-fit rectangle called **\"boxFit\"**."
msgstr "ブロブはしばしば複雑で不規則な形状を持っているため、ここでは **\"boxFit\"** と呼ばれる最適フィットの長方形で表現されています。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:27
msgid "Zoomed Color Blob detection"
msgstr "ズームカラー ブロブ検出"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:29
msgid ""
"The target color here is BLUE.  The white rectangle is the Region of "
"Interest (ROI), the teal jagged line is the Blob's contour (fully inside the"
" ROI), and the purple rectangle is the boxFit."
msgstr ""
"ここでのターゲットカラーは青です。白い長方形は関心領域（ROI）で、ティールのギザギザの線はブロブの輪郭（ROIの中に完全に収まっています）、紫の長方形はボックスフィットです。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:33
msgid ""
"The software reports the size, position and orientation of each \"boxFit\"."
"  That data can be evaluated by your OpMode for **robot navigation** and "
"other actions."
msgstr ""
"ソフトウェアは各「boxFit」のサイズ、位置、向きを報告します。そのデータは、 **robot navigation** "
"やその他のアクションのために、あなたのOp Modeによって評価されることができます。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:37
msgid "The following sections describe how to do this, with a Sample OpMode."
msgstr "以下のセクションでは、サンプルOp Modeを使用してこれを行う方法について説明します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:40
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "構成"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:42
msgid "*Skip this section if ...*"
msgstr "*Skip this section if ...*"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:44
msgid "*the active robot configuration already contains \"Webcam 1\",* or"
msgstr "*the active robot configuration already contains \"Webcam 1\",* または"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:45
msgid "*using the built-in camera of an Android phone as Robot Controller.*"
msgstr "*using the built-in camera of an Android phone as Robot Controller.*"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:47
msgid ""
"Before starting the programming, REV Control Hub users should make a robot "
"configuration that includes the USB webcam to be used as a color locator."
msgstr ""
"プログラミングを開始する前に、REV Control "
"Hubのユーザーは、色を検出するために使用するUSBウェブカメラを含むロボットの構成を作成する必要があります。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:50
msgid ""
"For now, use the default webcam name, \"Webcam 1\".  If a different name is "
"preferred, edit the Sample OpMode to agree with the exact webcam name in the"
" robot configuration."
msgstr ""
"今のところ、デフォルトのウェブカメラ名「Webcam 1」を使用してください。異なる名前を希望する場合は、サンプルOp "
"Modeを編集してロボット構成の正確なウェブカメラ名に一致させてください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Save and activate** that configuration; its name should appear on the "
"paired Driver Station screen."
msgstr ""
"**Save and activate** その構成; その名前はペアリングされた DRIVER STATION の画面に表示されるべきです。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:58
msgid "Sample OpMode"
msgstr "サンプル Op Mode"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:61
msgid "Opening the Sample OpMode"
msgstr "サンプル Op Mode を開く"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:63
msgid ""
"To learn about opening the Sample OpMode, select and read the Blocks **or** "
"Java section below:"
msgstr "Sample Op Modeを開く方法について学ぶには、以下のBlocks **or** Javaセクションを選択してお読みください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst
msgid "Blocks"
msgstr "Blocks"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:70
msgid ""
"On a laptop or desktop computer connected via Wi-Fi to the Robot Controller,"
" open the Chrome browser.  Go to the REV Control Hub's address "
"http://192.168.43.1:8080 (or http://192.168.49.1:8080 for Android RC phone) "
"and click the Blocks tab."
msgstr ""
"ノートパソコンまたはデスクトップコンピュータを使用して、Robot ControllerにWi-Fiで接続し、Chromeブラウザを開きます。REV "
"Control Hubのアドレス http://192.168.43.1:8080 （またはAndroid RC電話の場合は "
"http://192.168.49.1:8080 ）に移動し、Blocksタブをクリックします。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:76
msgid ""
"Click ``Create New OpMode``\\ , enter a new name such as "
"\"ColorLocator_Monica_v01\", and select the Sample OpMode "
"``ConceptVisionColorLocator_Rectangle``."
msgstr ""
"``Create New OpMode`` をクリックし、新しい名前「ColorLocator_Monica_v01」を入力し、サンプルOp Mode "
"``ConceptVisionColorLocator_Rectangle`` を選択します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:80
#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:99
msgid ""
"Near the beginning of the OpMode code, change `ARTIFACT_PURPLE` to `BLUE`."
msgstr "OpModeコードの冒頭近くで、`ARTIFACT_PURPLE`を`BLUE`に変更してください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:82
msgid ""
"At the top of the Blocks screen, you can change the type from \"TeleOp\" to "
"\"Autonomous\", since this Sample OpMode does not use gamepads."
msgstr ""
"Blocks画面の上部では、ゲームパッドを使用しないこのサンプルOp "
"Modeのため、「TeleOp」から「Autonomous」にタイプを変更することができます。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:85
msgid ""
"If using the built-in camera of an RC phone, drag out the relevant Block "
"from the left-side ``VisionPortal.Builder`` toolbox."
msgstr ""
"RCフォンの内蔵カメラを使用する場合は、左側の ``VisionPortal.Builder`` "
"ツールボックスから関連するブロックをドラッグアウトします。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:88
msgid "Save the OpMode, time to try it!"
msgstr "OpModeを保存しました。試してみましょう！"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst
msgid "Java"
msgstr "Java"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:93
msgid "Open your choice of OnBot Java or Android Studio."
msgstr "OnBot Java または Android Studio のいずれかを開いてください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:95
msgid ""
"In the ``teamcode`` folder, add/create a new OpMode with a name such as "
"\"ColorLocator_Javier_v01.java\", and select the Sample OpMode "
"``ConceptVisionColorLocator_Rectangle.java``."
msgstr ""
"``teamcode`` フォルダーに、新しいOp "
"Modeを\"ColorLocator_Javier_v01.java\"のような名前で追加/作成し、サンプルOp Mode "
"``__RST_FILEPATH_1__`` を選択してください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:101
msgid ""
"At about Line 63, you can change ``@TeleOp`` to ``@Autonomous``\\ , since "
"this Sample OpMode does not use gamepads."
msgstr ""
"約63行目で、 ``@TeleOp`` を ``@Autonomous`` に変更できます。このサンプルOp "
"Modeはゲームパッドを使用しないためです。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:104
msgid ""
"If using the built-in camera of an RC phone, follow the OpMode comments to "
"specify that camera."
msgstr "RCフォンの内蔵カメラを使用する場合は、Op Modeのコメントに従ってそのカメラを指定してください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:107
msgid "Click \"Build\", time to try it!"
msgstr "「ビルド」をクリックしてください。試してみましょう！"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:110
msgid "Running the Sample OpMode"
msgstr "サンプル Op Mode の実行"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:112
msgid ""
"On the Driver Station, select the Autonomous OpMode that you just saved or "
"built."
msgstr "Driver Stationで、保存またはビルドしたAutonomous OpModeを選択してください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:115
msgid ""
"Turn off the automatic 30-second match timer (green slider).  Aim the camera"
" at a **blue object**."
msgstr "自動30秒マッチタイマー（緑のスライダー）をオフにします。カメラを **blue object** に向けます。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:118
msgid ""
"Touch INIT only.  The OpMode should give Telemetry showing the results of "
"one or more Blobs:"
msgstr "INITのみをタッチしてください。Op Modeは、1つ以上のBlobの結果を示すTelemetryを提供する必要があります。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:126
msgid "Basic Telemetry"
msgstr "基本的なTelemetry"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:128
msgid ""
"In this example, the Region of Interest (ROI) contains only one Blob of the "
"default target color BLUE."
msgstr "この例では、関心領域（ROI）にはデフォルトのターゲットカラーである青色のブロブが1つだけ含まれています。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:131
msgid ""
"Move the camera around, especially at BLUE objects, and watch the Telemetry "
"area on the Driver Station screen.  It may sometimes show more lines of Blob"
" data, and sometimes show no Blob data at all."
msgstr ""
"カメラを動かし、特に青いオブジェクトに焦点を当てて、Driver "
"Stationの画面にあるTelemetryエリアを観察してください。時にはBlobデータの行が多く表示されることもありますが、全く表示されないこともあります。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:135
msgid ""
"It's working!  Your camera is working as a **color locator**.  Think about "
"how to use this in the FTC Robot Game."
msgstr ""
"動作しています！あなたのカメラは **color locator** "
"として機能しています。これをFTCロボットゲームでどのように活用するか考えてみてください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:138
msgid ""
"*Skip the next two sections, if you already know how to use FTC previews.*"
msgstr ""
"*Skip the next two sections, if you already know how to use FTC previews.*"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:141
msgid "DS Preview"
msgstr "DS プレビュー"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:143
msgid ""
"Before describing the telemetry data, this page offers two sections showing "
"how to view the OpenCV results with **previews**.  Previewing is essential "
"for working with vision code."
msgstr ""
"テレメトリデータについて説明する前に、このページでは **previews** を使用して OpenCV "
"の結果を表示する方法を示す2つのセクションを提供します。プレビューは、ビジョンコードを扱う上で重要です。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:147
msgid ""
"On the Driver Station (DS), remain in INIT -- don't touch the Start button."
msgstr "ドライバーステーション（DS）では、INITのままでいてください。スタートボタンには触れないでください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:149
msgid ""
"At the top right corner, touch the 3-dots menu, then ``Camera Stream``.  "
"This shows the camera's view; tap the image to refresh it."
msgstr ""
"右上隅の3点メニューをタッチし、次に ``Camera Stream`` "
"を選択します。これによりカメラのビューが表示されます。画像をタップして更新してください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:157
msgid "DS Camera Stream Preview"
msgstr "DS カメラストリームプレビュー"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:159
msgid ""
"The default target color here is BLUE.  The white rectangle is the Region of"
" Interest (ROI), the teal (light blue) jagged line is the Blob's contour "
"(fully inside the ROI), and the orange rectangle is the boxFit."
msgstr ""
"ここでのデフォルトのターゲットカラーは青です。白い長方形は関心領域（ROI）で、ティール（薄い青）のギザギザの線はBlobの輪郭（ROIの完全に内部）で、オレンジの長方形はboxFitです。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:163
msgid "For a BIG preview, touch the arrows at the bottom right corner."
msgstr "大きなプレビューを表示するには、右下隅の矢印をタッチしてください。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:165
msgid ""
"Or, select Camera Stream again, to return to the previous screen and its "
"Telemetry."
msgstr "または、Camera Streamを再度選択して、前の画面とそのTelemetryに戻ります。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:169
msgid "RC Preview"
msgstr "RC プレビュー"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:171
msgid ""
"The Robot Controller (RC) device also makes a preview, called ``LiveView``. "
"This is full video, and is shown automatically on the screen of an RC phone."
msgstr ""
"Robot Controller (RC) デバイスは、 ``LiveView`` "
"と呼ばれるプレビューも作成します。これはフルビデオであり、RCフォンの画面に自動的に表示されます。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:179
msgid "Image of a LiveView stream"
msgstr "LiveViewストリームの画像"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:179
msgid "LiveView stream"
msgstr "LiveView ストリーム"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:181
msgid "The above preview is from a REV Control Hub."
msgstr "上記のプレビューはREV Robotics Control Hubからのものです。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:183
msgid ""
"It has no physical screen, so you must plug in an HDMI monitor **or** use "
"open-source `scrcpy <https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy>`_ (called "
"\"screen copy\") to see the preview on a laptop or computer that's connected"
" via Wi-Fi to the Control Hub."
msgstr ""
"物理的な画面はないため、HDMIモニターを接続して、オープンソースの `scrcpy "
"<https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy>`_ （「スクリーンコピー」と呼ばれる）を使用して、Wi-"
"Fi経由でControl Hubに接続されたPCやコンピュータでプレビューを見る必要があります。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:189
msgid "Basic Telemetry Data"
msgstr "基本的なTelemetryデータ"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:191
msgid "Let's look closer at the DS telemetry:"
msgstr "DSのTelemetryを詳しく見てみましょう："

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:198
msgid "Image of telemetry output"
msgstr "Telemetry出力の画像"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:198
msgid "Locator Telemetry"
msgstr "ロケーターテレメトリ"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:200
msgid ""
"In this example, the Region of Interest (ROI) contains only one Blob of the "
"default target color BLUE.  You could probably move your camera to achieve "
"the same result - with the help of previews."
msgstr ""
"この例では、関心領域（ROI）にはデフォルトのターゲットカラーである青色のブロブが1つだけ含まれています。同様の結果を得るために、プレビューを利用してカメラを移動させることもできるでしょう。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:204
msgid ""
"The **first column** shows the (X, Y) position of the **Center** of the "
"boxFit rectangle.  With the origin at the full image's top left corner, X "
"increases to the right and Y increases downward."
msgstr ""
"**first column** は、boxFit矩形の **Center** の(X, "
"Y)位置を示します。原点はフルイメージの左上隅にあり、Xは右に向かって増加し、Yは下に向かって増加します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:208
msgid ""
"The **second column** shows the **Area**, in pixels, of the Blob (contour, "
"not boxFit).  By default, the Sample OpMode uses a **filter** to show Blobs "
"between 50 and 20,000 pixels.  Also by default, the Sample uses a **sort** "
"tool to display multiple Blobs in descending order of Area (largest is "
"first)."
msgstr ""
"**second column** は、Blob（輪郭、boxFitではない）のピクセル単位の **Area** "
"を表示します。デフォルトでは、Sample Op Modeは50から20,000ピクセルの間のBlobを表示するために **filter** "
"を使用します。また、デフォルトでは、Sampleは面積の降順（最大が最初）で複数のBlobを表示するために **sort** ツールを使用します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:213
msgid ""
"The **third column** shows the **Density** of the Blob contour.  From the "
"Sample comments:"
msgstr "**third column** は Blob の輪郭の **Density** を示しています。サンプルのコメントから："

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:218
msgid ""
"*A blob's density is an indication of how \"full\" the contour is.  If you "
"put a rubber band around the contour you would get the \"Convex Hull\" of "
"the contour.  The density is the ratio of Contour-area to Convex Hull-area.*"
msgstr ""
"*A blob's density is an indication of how \"full\" the contour is.  If you "
"put a rubber band around the contour you would get the \"Convex Hull\" of "
"the contour.  The density is the ratio of Contour-area to Convex Hull-area.*"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:223
msgid ""
"The **fourth column** shows the **Aspect Ratio of the boxFit**, the best-fit"
" rectangle around the contour:"
msgstr ""
"**fourth column** は、輪郭の周りの最適な矩形である **Aspect Ratio of the boxFit** を示しています。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:228
msgid ""
"*A blob's Aspect Ratio is the ratio of boxFit long side to short side.  A "
"perfect Square has an Aspect Ratio of 1.  All others are > 1.*"
msgstr ""
"*A blob's Aspect Ratio is the ratio of boxFit long side to short side.  A "
"perfect Square has an Aspect Ratio of 1.  All others are > 1.*"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:233
msgid ""
"The boxFit is not required to stay inside the ROI.  Also the boxFit may be "
"**tilted** at some angle, namely not horizontal.  This will be discussed "
"more in a later page."
msgstr ""
"boxFitはROI内に留まる必要はありません。また、boxFitは特定の角度、すなわち水平でない場合に **tilted** "
"になることがあります。これについては後のページでさらに詳しく説明します。"

#: ../../source/color_processing/color-locator-discover/color-locator-discover.rst:237
msgid ""
"The fifth and sixth columns are described in a later page called :doc:`Color"
" Locator (Round Blobs) <../color-locator-round-blobs/color-locator-round-"
"blobs>`."
msgstr ""
"第五および第六の列については、後のページである :doc:`Color Locator (Round Blobs) <../color-locator-"
"round-blobs/color-locator-round-blobs>` に記載されています。"

